        "problem": "Which statement is equivalent to $(\u00acP\u2227Q)\u2228R?$",
        "worked_solution": "We distribute the disjunction over the conjunction, as follows:\n\n$$\n(\u00acP\u2227Q)\u2228R\u2261(\u00acP\u2228R)\u2227(Q\u2228R)\n$$\n\nNow, since $\u00acP\u2228R\u2261R\u2228\u00acP$ and $Q\u2228R\u2261R\u2228Q$ we can write\n\n$$\n(\u00acP\u2228R)\u2227(Q\u2228R)\u2261(R\u2228\u00acP)\u2227(R\u2228Q).\n$$",
